# CQ09: Jalur biologis manusia (Reactome) apa saja yang dipengaruhi oleh mekanisme kerja imatinib?
# EN:   Which human Reactome pathways are affected by imatinib's mechanism of action?
# Expected: Signaling by PDGF, Signaling by SCF-KIT, PIP3 activates AKT signaling, Regulation of KIT signaling,
#           Role of ABL in ROBO-SLIT signaling, Downstream signal transduction, Myogenesis,
#           Regulation of actin dynamics for phagocytic cup formation
# Type: CONSTRUCT
# Note: materialises the property chain :affectsPathway = :targets o :hasComponent o :participatesIn
#       with a SPARQL property path, so no OWL reasoner is needed.
PREFIX :     <https://itb.ac.id/a5103/tubes_2#>
PREFIX res:  <https://itb.ac.id/a5103/tubes_2/resource/>
PREFIX rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#>
PREFIX xsd:  <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#>

CONSTRUCT {
  ?drug :affectsPathway ?pathway ;
        rdfs:label ?drugName .
  ?pathway rdfs:label ?pathwayName .
}
WHERE {
  ?drug a :Drug ;
        rdfs:label ?drugName .
  FILTER (LCASE(STR(?drugName)) = "imatinib")
  ?drug :targets/:hasComponent/:participatesIn ?pathway .
  ?pathway rdfs:label ?pathwayName .
}
